    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. van Beethoven returns five weeks after his first visit. He had the MRI this morning, and audiology fitted his hearing aids an hour ago. In the fitting room he heard the turn of a page and the high strings of a recording he had not heard clearly in two years, and the tinnitus seemed to recede while the aids were in. He has had three therapy sessions and is keeping a tinnitus diary. He sleeps better with a sound machine. He picked up his musicians&apos; earplugs. He has had no sudden change in hearing or dizziness. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MRI</td><td>Done this morning</td></tr><tr><td>Hearing aids</td><td>Fitted today, both ears</td></tr><tr><td>Tinnitus</td><td>Less noticeable with the aids and the sound machine</td></tr><tr><td>Therapy</td><td>Three sessions</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>PHQ-9 9</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

